      "id": "tab3",
      "title": "Đọc 例文(れいぶん) (ví dụ)",
      "titleHtml": "Đọc <ruby>例文<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> (ví dụ)",
      "contentHtml": "</p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111101102.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1</span>. </span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai7_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>テレビで <ruby>日本語<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しましたか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">1) Anh/chị đã học tiếng Nhật trên ti-vi phải không?</div></div></div></span></p> <p align=\"left\"> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; いいえ、ラジオで <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip; Không, tôi học trên radio.</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2</span>. <div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai7_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>日本語<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で レポートを <ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">2) Anh/chị sẽ viết báo cáo bằng tiếng Nhật chứ?</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; いいえ、<ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Không, tôi sẽ viết bằng tiếng Anh.</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3</span>. <div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai7_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&ldquo;Goodbye&rdquo;は <ruby>日本語<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">3) &ldquo;Goodbye&rdquo; tiếng Nhật nói thế nào?</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;「さようなら」です。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tiếng Nhật nói là &ldquo;Sayonara&rdquo;</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4</span>. <div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai7_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>だれに <ruby>年賀状<rp>(</rp><rt>ねんがじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きますか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">4) Anh/chị viết thiệp chúc tết sinh cho ai?</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; <ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と <ruby>友達<rp>(</rp><rt>ともだち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Tôi viết cho giáo viên và bạn b&egrave;.</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5</span>. <div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai7_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>それは <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Cái đó là cái g&igrave;?</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; <ruby>手帳<rp>(</rp><rt>てちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。 <ruby>山田<rp>(</rp><rt>やまだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんに もらいました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Là quyển sổ tay. Tôi được anh Yamada tặng.</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6</span>. <div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai7_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>もう <ruby>新幹線<rp>(</rp><rt>しんかんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>切符<rp>(</rp><rt>きっぷ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いましたか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"> Anh/chị đã mua vé tàu Shinkansen chưa?</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; はい、もう <ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Rồi, tôi đã mua rồi.</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">7.</span> <div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai7_rb_7.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>もう <ruby>昼<rp>(</rp><rt>ひる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ごはんを <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べましたか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">  Anh/chị đã ăn cơm trưa chưa?</div></div></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; いいえ、まだです。これから <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">&hellip;Chưa, tôi chưa ăn. Bây giờ tôi sẽ ăn.</div></div></div></span></p> <p> </div>",
